   260	-- libetech_runtime may only requeue dead rows (attempt_no reset to 0) or abandon dead/uncertain rows.
   261	-- While the state stays the same, for every role (Codex review P1): attempt_no, next_attempt_at, lease_token, lease_expires_at and
   262	-- last_error_code do not change. They change only together with a state move, which goes through applyOutboxSignal: version +1 and
